WEBVTT

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:30.530
But I'm not talking
about bravery or courage.

00:00:30.554 --> 00:00:32.754
I mean literally -- I have balls.

00:00:33.268 --> 00:00:34.569
Right here,

00:00:34.593 --> 00:00:36.601
right where a lot of you have ovaries.

00:00:37.157 --> 00:00:39.116
I'm not male or female.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.290
I'm intersex.

00:00:41.316 --> 00:00:45.141
Most people assume that you're
biologically either a man or a woman,

00:00:45.165 --> 00:00:47.992
but it's actually a lot more
complex than that.

00:00:49.395 --> 00:00:51.911
There are so many ways
somebody could be intersex.

00:00:51.935 --> 00:00:54.982
In my case, it means
I was born with XY chromosomes,

00:00:55.006 --> 00:00:57.202
which you probably know
as male chromosomes.

00:00:57.562 --> 00:01:01.938
And I was born with a vagina
and balls inside my body.